      "page": 10,
      "ruku": 9,
      "hizbQuarter": 4,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 72,
      "text": "And you know about those among you who broke the Sabbath, whereupon We said to them, “Be apes, despised.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 2,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَقَرَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Baqara",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cow",
        "numberOfAyahs": 286,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 65,
      "juz": 1,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 10,
      "ruku": 9,
      "hizbQuarter": 4,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 73,
      "text": "So We made it a deterrent punishment for those alive and for those who succeeded them, and an admonition for the righteous.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 2,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَقَرَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Baqara",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cow",
        "numberOfAyahs": 286,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 66,
      "juz": 1,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 10,
      "ruku": 9,
      "hizbQuarter": 4,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 74,
      "text": "And [remember] when Moses said to his people, “Allah commands you to slaughter a cow.” They said, “Are you mocking us?” Moses said, “I seek refuge in Allah from being among the ignorant!”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 2,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَقَرَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Baqara",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cow",
        "numberOfAyahs": 286,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 67,
      "juz": 1,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 10,
      "ruku": 9,
      "hizbQuarter": 4,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 75,
      "text": "They said, “Call upon your Lord to make clear to us what [type of cow] it is.” He said, “Allah says, ‘It is a cow that is neither too old nor too young, but somewhere in between. So do as you are commanded!’”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 2,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَقَرَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Baqara",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cow",
        "numberOfAyahs": 286,
