      "hizbQuarter": 4,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 76,
      "text": "They said, “Call upon your Lord to show us its color.” He said, “Allah says, ‘It is a yellow cow, bright in color – pleasing to the beholders.’”",
